WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.537
Peter: Mrs. Kelly, what time is it?

2
00:00:04.538 --> 00:00:06.469
Teacher: It’s one o’clock.

3
00:00:06.470 --> 00:00:12.928
Let’s line up.

4
00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:16.653
Minwoo: Excuse me, what time is it?

5
00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:22.148
Zookeeper: It’s two o’clock.

6
00:00:22.149 --> 00:00:25.966
Sally: What time is it?

7
00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:32.713
Minwoo: It’s three o’clock!

8
00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:35.725
Teacher: Children, it’s four

9
00:00:35.726 --> 00:00:38.630
o’clock. It’s time to go home.

10
00:00:38.631 --> 00:00:44.015
Zookeeper: Good-bye!

